  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Water Supply &amp; Sanitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objectives of this project are for the majority of villages in the Issyk-Kul, Naryn and Talas oblasts (i) to have improved access to potable water from water supply systems which the communities own, operate maintain and manage in a sustainable manner; and (ii) to improve hygiene, sanitation and water-related practices at individual, family and institutional levels in the rural areas.</narrative>
  </description>
